                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your patient, a 26-year-old female, who presented on 17/04/2016 with lower abdominal pain and a positive pregnancy test. Clinical examination and transvaginal ultrasound confirmed a right-sided tubal ectopic pregnancy without signs of rupture. Serum beta-hCG levels were significantly elevated. Given the clinical findings and patient's hemodynamic stability, she was counseled regarding surgical management. On 18/04/2016, she underwent laparoscopic salpingectomy of the affected right fallopian tube, which was performed without complications. Histopathology confirmed ectopic implantation. Postoperative recovery was uneventful. She was discharged on 21/04/2016 in good general condition. Wound care instructions and follow-up recommendations were provided. Please ensure close outpatient follow-up including repeat beta-hCG monitoring and contraceptive counseling.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
